{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 75,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.13128662109375,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "There is also a risk of delaying effective treatment, especially in children infected",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        301.2528381347656,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "with HIV, who may have tuberculosis as the cause of CSOM.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        97.26070404052734,
        205.30300903320312,
        109.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "8.4.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.91542053222656,
        399.1229248046875,
        126.4054183959961
      ],
      "text": "Although this has been previously recommended, the use of topical antiseptics has",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.91542053222656,
        399.0328369140625,
        139.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "not been widespread due to limited availability. The current evidence does not justify",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        399.032958984375,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "the cost or the potential discomfort associated with the use of topical antiseptics; as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.15277099609375,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "a result, they will be less accepted by clinicians. Antibiotics would be much preferred",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        185.94287109375,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "to the use of topical antiseptics.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.0915222167969,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Topical antiseptics are not currently part of the WHO Essential Medicines List for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        154.35292053222656,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Children (WHO, 2010).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        214.462890625,
        392.6441345214844,
        227.65188598632812
      ],
      "text": "8.5\t Topical steroids for treatment of Chronic Suppurative Otitis Media",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        227.462890625,
        126.44770050048828,
        240.65188598632812
      ],
      "text": "(CSOM)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        244.08860778808594,
        399.0429382324219,
        257.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Topical steroids should not be used in treating chronic suppurative otitis media",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        257.0885925292969,
        93.05290222167969,
        270.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "(CSOM).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        272.4931945800781,
        269.5429382324219,
        286.4132080078125
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, very low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        300.2763977050781,
        231.48292541503906,
        312.2663879394531
      ],
      "text": "8.5.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.93109130859375,
        399.0328674316406,
        329.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "A PubMed search was conducted using the terms ‘chronic suppurative otitis media’",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.93109130859375,
        399.11297607421875,
        342.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "and ‘steroids’. Forty-five results were retrieved; there was only one relevant study from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.93109130859375,
        399.12286376953125,
        355.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "Malaysia [Indudharan 2005]. The most recent review the panel could find was from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.93109130859375,
        399.04278564453125,
        368.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "2006 [Verhoeff, 2006], and this concluded that there had been no formal evaluations",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.93109130859375,
        399.11279296875,
        381.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "of the role of topical steroids up to that point. The 2004 WHO report on Chronic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.93109130859375,
        399.0528869628906,
        394.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "Suppurative Otitis Media [WHO, 2004] was also consulted to cross-check results and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.93109130859375,
        165.09292602539062,
        407.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "identify indirect evidence.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        406.93109130859375,
        399.0713806152344,
        420.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "Overall, the only study identified that directly evaluated the role of steroids in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.93109130859375,
        399.0627746582031,
        433.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "CSOM shows no difference in outcomes between two groups treated with antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.93109130859375,
        399.0728759765625,
        446.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "with steroids and antibiotics without steroids. Indirect evidence suggests that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.93109130859375,
        399.0228576660156,
        459.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "steroids may have a role in improving the efficacy of topical quinolones and reducing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.93109130859375,
        399.02288818359375,
        472.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "the toxicity of amingoglycosides. However, there is currently insufficient evidence to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.93109130859375,
        293.3729248046875,
        485.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "support their use in the treatment of children with CSOM.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        484.93109130859375,
        399.10150146484375,
        498.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "Indudharan (2005) conducted a non-blinded, quasi-randomized trial in Malaysia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        497.93109130859375,
        399.082763671875,
        511.4211120605469
      ],
      "text": "to assess the role of topical steroids in the management of CSOM with perforation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        510.93109130859375,
        399.1328430175781,
        524.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "Subjects with specialist-diagnosed CSOM with perforation (no diagnostic criteria",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.9310913085938,
        399.0827941894531,
        537.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "provided), but no complications, were enrolled. The external ear of these patients",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.9310913085938,
        397.8428955078125,
        550.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "were cleaned with antiseptic and dried. The middle ear was then cleaned by suction.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        549.9310913085938,
        399.0714111328125,
        563.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "Consecutive subjects were alternately divided into two groups to receive either",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.9310913085938,
        399.06280517578125,
        576.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "0.3% gentamicin or 0.3% gentamicin with 0.1% betamethasone combination drops.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.9310913085938,
        399.1427917480469,
        589.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "Treatment was continued for 3 weeks, with follow-up at the end of week 4. Middle ear",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        588.9310913085938,
        399.123046875,
        602.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "swabs and pure-tone audiogram were performed pre- and post-treatment. Outcomes",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.9310913085938,
        399.123046875,
        615.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "were clinical and bacteriological improvement. Clinical improvement was defined as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.45469665527344,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.5906982421875,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "61",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}